  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <p>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d4f7dc3135f0c9d847e1d7b1aeb4ca62b7b1701.png\" alt=\"扩展战斗 史诗之战 标题图片\" width=\"445\" height=\"110\">\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-ef-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3494a91b8d02c32063e94ab08f6dd796b5bb4634.png\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 获取\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\">\n    </a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a7bff26028f093d51d9da01e07e384f91f63ae13.png\" alt=\"需要 Cloth Config API\" width=\"212\" height=\"56\">\n    </a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5aec5c41ae6f0aac946a80fe3cf688a7a336fa09_0.webp\" alt=\"需要 Curios API\" width=\"179\" height=\"56\">\n    </a> \n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/59e9eeade55f309be535f0b860f0219c8863d4b0_0.webp\" alt=\"需要 Expanded Combat\" width=\"252\" height=\"56\">\n    </a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7db449d64830a8a5302c1c9bb607c563dfc6d9c9_0.webp\" alt=\"需要 Epic Fight\" width=\"170\" height=\"56\">\n    </a>\n  </p>\n</div>\n<p>一款为<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a>及其由 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/userofbricks/followers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Userofbricks</a> 制作的插件添加与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>武器动画系统兼容性的模组。</p>\n<p>目前，该模组已支持原版模组 Expanded Combat 添加的所有武器。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>从本模组 1.2.0 版本起，现已可以为饰品（Curios）物品添加模型。</strong>标准造型的拳套模型已添加，但自定义造型的拳套（如原版模组中的 Maulers 或 Cataclysm 插件中的紫水晶蟹拳套）将不会拥有模型。此外，箭袋的模型尚未添加。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><strong>重要提示：</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>如需报告 Bug，请使用 GitHub 上的问题追踪器：<a href=\"https://github.com/userofbricks/Expanded-Combat/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>如有其他需求想要交流/聊天，请使用 Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7cR4Vwv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</strong></p>\n<p>点击横幅获取折扣：<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/91cdbb92-a3db-4f62-a182-239fe5589b2a.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
